@startuml
title Figure 9. Tenant Boundary and Inherited Administration
top to bottom direction

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "Tenant A (root = A)" {
  rectangle "University A" as A
  rectangle "Faculty A1" as A1
  rectangle "Department A1.1" as A11
  rectangle "Club A2" as A2

  A --> A1 : parent
  A1 --> A11 : parent
  A --> A2 : parent
}

rectangle "Tenant B (root = B)" {
  rectangle "University B" as B
  rectangle "Faculty B1" as B1
  B --> B1 : parent
}

actor "Admin of Faculty A1" as Admin

Admin --> A1 : allowed
Admin --> A11 : allowed as descendant
Admin -[#black,dashed]-> A : denied: ancestor
Admin -[#black,dashed]-> A2 : denied: different branch
Admin -[#black,dashed]-> B1 : denied: different tenant

note bottom
An admin manages their organization and its descendants only.
Every request must also stay inside the same root tenant.
end note
@enduml
